      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انحتم</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a thing, or an affair, or event,)
<i>was,</i> or <i>became, absolutely,</i> or <i>decisively,</i> or <i>irreversibly, necessary, requisite,</i> or <i>unavoidable;</i> as
